    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "ビワハヤヒデ",
            "enName": "Biwa Hayahide",
            "jpText": "ブライアン……母さんに泣きつかれたぞ。\r\nメールや電話の折り返しがないと。",
            "enText": "Brian… I received a call from our mother.\nEvidently you aren't returning her calls or\nmessages.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -747970378677916268,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ビワハヤヒデ",
            "enName": "Biwa Hayahide",
            "jpText": "元気なのか、気にかけた様子だった。\r\n学園でどんな生活をしているか、とかな。",
            "enText": "She was asking all sorts of questions.\nMostly about your life in school.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 7949061488404509915,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタブライアン",
            "enName": "Narita Brian",
            "jpText": "……面倒だな。",
            "enText": "…What a pain.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -5202353816449830659,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ビワハヤヒデ",
            "enName": "Biwa Hayahide",
            "jpText": "だろうと思い、伝えておいた。レースの戦績、\r\nヒシアマ君のキャラ弁を食べた話……。",
            "enText": "I figured you'd say as much. So I told her\nabout your race records and the adorable\nlunchbox Hishiama made you…",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -2129128573806333971,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタブライアン",
            "enName": "Narita Brian",
            "jpText": "な！？　な、なんでそれを……。",
            "enText": "Huh?! Wh-Where'd you hear about that…",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -4101946569224140646,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ビワハヤヒデ",
            "enName": "Biwa Hayahide",
            "jpText": "？　ヒシアマ君から聞いたぞ。先ほども、\r\nお前が後輩に手紙をもらった話を――",
            "enText": "Hm? From Hishiama, of course.\nWhich reminds me, she told me you\nreceived a letter from another student—",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 5048512771242231294,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタブライアン",
            "enName": "Narita Brian",
            "jpText": "いい、わかった！　おふくろとは私が話す！",
            "enText": "Okay, I get it! I'll call Mom!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -5409356388966604625,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ビワハヤヒデ",
            "enName": "Biwa Hayahide",
            "jpText": "……そうか！\r\nよかった、母さんもきっと喜ぶぞ！",
            "enText": "Oh! Thank you, I'm sure Mother\nwill be quite pleased!",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 3942752724386507010,
            "blockIdx": 8
        }
    ],
    "modified": 1780170110,
    "humanTl": true
}